<title>USA: General Host sets five pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>General Host sets five pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Host Corp said Wednesday its board of directors declared a five-percent stock dividend on its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable April 4 to shareholders of record on March 14, it said.</p>
<p>In February 1996, the company also declared a five-percent stock split.</p>
<p>General Host is a specialty retailer of lawn and garden products as well as crafts, pet supplies and Christmas merchandise.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
